<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3012" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăpĭānus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		apis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>belonging to bees</i>, <i>of bees.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			Adj., uva, loved by bees, <i>the
			muscatel</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 14, 2, 4, § 3</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Col. 12,
				39, 3</span></i>; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					3, 2, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					12, 47, 6</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăpĭāna</span></b> ,
			ae, f. (sc. herba), <i>chamomile</i>, <i><span class="en">App. Herb.
		23</span></i>.</div>
